=== ADJUDICATION VERDICT (pooled hard subset): explanation_1_mechanistic ===
Within-model trajectories show benchmark rising while knowledge-base ranking falls for a majority of seeds, including on the hard cross-sentence subset and on gene-disease pairs where non-drug chemical pool inflation cannot explain the drop. This pattern is evidence for a genuine training-dynamics erosion effect over and above static criterion and pool-composition differences.
Round 1 found KB gene-drug variance was about 64% within-encoder seed noise and 36% between encoders, so between-model comparisons had limited power. Within-seed paired changes across training remove between-seed noise and are the appropriate design for detecting a training-dynamics effect.

